---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Use — Habiterr"
  description="The end user license agreement and terms of use for the Habiterr app."
>
  <Nav />
  <main id="main" class="pt-28 pb-16">
    <article class="container-page max-w-3xl">
      <header class="mb-10">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight">Terms of Use (EULA)</h1>
      </header>

      <div class="legal-prose">
        <h2>Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing Habiterr, you agree to be bound by these terms, all applicable laws and
          regulations, and acknowledge responsibility for compliance with local laws. Disagreement
          with these terms prohibits use of the app. Materials in Habiterr are protected by
          copyright and trademark law.
        </p>

        <h2>Use License</h2>
        <p>
          Permission allows temporarily downloading one copy of Habiterr per device for personal,
          non-commercial viewing only. This grants a license, not title transfer. Under this
          license, you may not:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Modify or copy the materials</li>
          <li>Use materials for commercial purposes or public display</li>
          <li>Attempt to decompile or reverse engineer software in Habiterr</li>
          <li>Remove copyright or proprietary notations</li>
          <li>Transfer materials to others or mirror them on other servers</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          This license shall automatically terminate if you violate any of these restrictions, or
          the Developer may terminate it anytime. Upon termination, you must destroy downloaded
          materials in all formats.
        </p>

        <h2>Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>
          Materials are provided “as is.” The Developer makes no warranties and disclaims all
          others, including merchantability, fitness for purpose, or non-infringement. The
          Developer doesn't warrant the accuracy, results, or reliability of materials or linked
          sites.
        </p>

        <h2>Limitations</h2>
        <p>
          The Developer and suppliers aren't liable for damages from using or inability to use
          Habiterr, even if notified of potential damage. Jurisdictional limitations on implied
          warranties may not apply to you.
        </p>

        <h2>Accuracy of Materials</h2>
        <p>
          Materials may contain errors. The Developer doesn't warrant accuracy or completeness and
          may change materials without notice, though doesn't commit to updates.
        </p>

        <h2>Links</h2>
        <p>
          The Developer hasn't reviewed linked sites and isn't responsible for their contents.
          Links don't imply endorsement. Users assume risk with linked websites.
        </p>

        <h2>Modifications</h2>
        <p>
          The Developer may revise these terms anytime without notice. Using Habiterr means
          accepting the current version.
        </p>

        <h2>Governing Law</h2>
        <p>
          These terms are governed by Ukrainian law with exclusive jurisdiction in Ukrainian
          courts.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about these terms may be directed to
          <a href="mailto:raf.rafiki@gmail.com">raf.rafiki@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 pt-6 border-t border-[var(--color-stroke)] text-sm">
        <a href="/" class="text-[var(--color-text-muted)] hover:text-white transition-colors">
          ← Back to home
        </a>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-prose {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }
  .legal-prose p {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  .legal-prose h2 {
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .legal-prose ul {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  .legal-prose li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .legal-prose a {
    color: var(--color-accent-teal);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
  .legal-prose a:hover {
    color: #fff;
  }
</style>
